WEBVTT

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:22.122
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:26.626
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:30.697
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:35.301
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:43.343
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:54.117
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:58.558
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:02.996
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:07.067
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:14.735
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:35.156
The desert has many legends.

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:49.030
It is said that travelers sometimes
encounter these legends.

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:50.837
Just like this traveler,

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:54.878
who has lost his way and finds
himself on the verge of death...

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:56.582
Live.

00:01:57.484 --> 00:01:59.611
For life is meant to live.

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:02.779
It is life's duty to survive.

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:13.058
So live.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:15.830
You are...

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:22.439
I will live...

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:30.676
Hey, are you okay?!

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:33.052
We've been looking for you!
It's a miracle you're okay!

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:35.111
I was saved...

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:36.821
Who saved you?

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:40.653
The Fairy... The Desert Fairy...

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:46.358
The desert has many legends.

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:51.668
Desert Folklore

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:54.567
I don't really know if that
was the Phantom or not,

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:56.125
but it just disappeared after that.

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:01.063
Impossible. Impossible!

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:04.544
A desert ghost is unscientific!

00:04:04.544 --> 00:04:07.411
It's dangerous to get stuck
in an inflexible mindset.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.149
There are plenty of other stories like that.

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:12.685
Desert ghosts, desert fairies...

00:04:12.685 --> 00:04:13.583
There are...

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.222
...numerous legends of this sort,

00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:19.158
and I think it's questionable
to reject them out of hand.

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:20.226
Exactly.

00:04:20.226 --> 00:04:22.295
After all, it's not like this little lady...

00:04:22.295 --> 00:04:26.095
...leads the quiet life in
an ivory tower like we do.

00:04:26.699 --> 00:04:27.934
Ow, that hurts.

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:30.801
Right? We're no match for someone
speaking from experience.

00:04:31.337 --> 00:04:32.572
Thanks for the food.

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:35.097
We won't get anywhere without
a theory to corroborate.

00:04:35.475 --> 00:04:39.445
I'm just saying it's dangerous to
value experience above all else.

00:04:39.445 --> 00:04:42.715
Theories start from a hunch and
the backbone of that hunch...

00:04:42.715 --> 00:04:44.307
...is the accumulation of data
based on experience!

00:04:48.388 --> 00:04:50.657
These past 20 days or so,

00:04:50.657 --> 00:04:53.059
Honoka has accompanied a
scientific investigation team...

00:04:53.059 --> 00:04:54.458
...conducting field work.

00:04:55.528 --> 00:04:58.827
It was Honoka's job to provide
protection for the group.

00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:04.737
You seem to have quite a bit of pent up stress.

00:05:04.737 --> 00:05:06.329
I wouldn't exactly say that.

00:05:06.773 --> 00:05:08.832
But well, a certain degree of mental
exhaustion is to be expected.

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:12.176
I hear scholars are a difficult breed.

00:05:12.412 --> 00:05:13.401
I guess.

00:05:13.646 --> 00:05:15.214
But it's been surprisingly fun.

00:05:15.214 --> 00:05:17.375
When you get down to it,
they all know so much stuff.

00:05:18.418 --> 00:05:21.046
I get to hear about all sorts of things, and...

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:22.281
What's wrong?

00:05:52.018 --> 00:05:53.349
Is something the matter?

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:56.354
It's just a wolf, right?
Though it's a bit on the large side.

00:05:58.124 --> 00:06:00.820
I felt... something...

00:06:15.041 --> 00:06:17.243
It hurts, Teacher! Hurry! Hurry!

00:06:17.243 --> 00:06:20.212
I'm gonna die! Hurry up and stop the bleeding!

00:06:20.747 --> 00:06:22.248
Quit exaggerating.

00:06:22.248 --> 00:06:24.350
Come on, look! See? Blood!

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:26.152
I'm gonna die of massive hermo-raging!

00:06:26.152 --> 00:06:28.354
You mean "massive hemorrhaging".

00:06:28.354 --> 00:06:29.922
It's stopped already.

00:06:29.922 --> 00:06:30.445
Huh?

00:06:32.558 --> 00:06:33.820
There, all done.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.628
That's it?

00:06:35.628 --> 00:06:36.617
That's it.

00:06:38.131 --> 00:06:40.266
Teacher, please take a look at this girl.

00:06:40.266 --> 00:06:41.434
What's wrong?

00:06:41.434 --> 00:06:43.834
It was like she suddenly fell into a coma...

00:06:44.237 --> 00:06:46.865
She won't wake up, no matter what I do.

00:06:49.475 --> 00:06:50.840
Millie...

00:06:51.177 --> 00:06:52.474
Give it a rest already!

00:06:53.112 --> 00:06:54.680
Like I told ya!

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.883
I ain't saying that I can't pay!

00:06:56.883 --> 00:06:59.419
Right! So pay up already and get lost!

00:06:59.419 --> 00:07:02.488
Just, ain't that a tad bit expensive?

00:07:02.488 --> 00:07:04.390
I'm feeling the pinch here, too.

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:06.092
That's not my problem!

00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:08.094
If you don't even know what
this stuff costs around here,

00:07:08.094 --> 00:07:09.220
this place isn't for you!

00:07:09.328 --> 00:07:12.331
Hey, kid, you keep giving me that lip and...

00:07:12.331 --> 00:07:15.266
You better not take this dockyard lightly!

00:07:15.601 --> 00:07:16.836
Why you!

00:07:16.836 --> 00:07:18.104
Having trouble there?

00:07:18.104 --> 00:07:18.502
What?

00:07:19.238 --> 00:07:20.773
Stay out of this...

00:07:20.773 --> 00:07:21.707
Who the hell're you?

00:07:21.707 --> 00:07:22.708
Miss!

00:07:22.708 --> 00:07:25.978
I don't really care, but I've
got business with him, too.

00:07:25.978 --> 00:07:27.741
Do you mind wrapping it up quick?

00:07:28.247 --> 00:07:30.216
You sure talk the big talk, lady!

00:07:30.216 --> 00:07:33.185
If you wanna play patty cake,
I'll keep you company, though.

00:07:34.787 --> 00:07:37.657
B-Bitch! That hurt!

00:07:37.657 --> 00:07:40.820
You're still not done here?
Hurry up and finis-

00:07:41.327 --> 00:07:42.885
Hold on a second.

00:07:43.229 --> 00:07:46.165
There's a cocky little brat
that I gotta punish first...

00:07:46.165 --> 00:07:47.996
Conwell, wait! Wait!

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:49.031
Why?!

00:07:49.235 --> 00:07:52.068
I-I-It's the Sword Dancer!

00:07:57.009 --> 00:07:58.476
Sw-Sw-Sw-Sw-Sw-Sw...

00:07:58.578 --> 00:07:59.408
We're leaving!

00:07:59.512 --> 00:08:01.912
Sw-Sword D-D-Dancer?!

00:08:03.015 --> 00:08:04.817
Quite the notoriety you got there, Miss.

00:08:04.817 --> 00:08:06.385
Give me a break!

00:08:06.385 --> 00:08:07.787
Talking about notoriety and calling me Miss...

00:08:07.787 --> 00:08:10.490
If anyone else heard, they'd never
think I made an honest living.

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:12.082
So you make an honest living, do you?

00:08:12.191 --> 00:08:13.359
Well, that's...

00:08:13.359 --> 00:08:14.189
...questionable.

00:08:14.994 --> 00:08:17.189
So, what are you in for today?

00:08:17.797 --> 00:08:19.492
Just do some light maintenance.

00:08:20.032 --> 00:08:21.467
Don't give me that.

00:08:21.467 --> 00:08:23.135
I'm getting a lot of recognition, you know.

00:08:23.135 --> 00:08:24.470
Like even at the technical school.

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:26.097
I didn't mean anything by it.

00:08:26.205 --> 00:08:28.374
It just hasn't been that long since the overhaul.

00:08:28.374 --> 00:08:30.069
You can't exactly get away with that.

00:08:30.376 --> 00:08:32.970
You've still got a couple parts
that you ought to replace.

00:08:33.646 --> 00:08:35.081
Oh, here's another one.

00:08:35.081 --> 00:08:38.184
What the heck? You've accumulated
a lot of wear and tear.

00:08:38.184 --> 00:08:39.515
Bogie too, huh?

00:08:40.253 --> 00:08:41.311
What do you mean "too"?

00:08:41.387 --> 00:08:44.891
Well, I got a lecture from Old Man Nor...

00:08:44.891 --> 00:08:46.518
...that I should take a break.

00:08:47.593 --> 00:08:51.393
Though, it's true that things
have been hectic lately.

00:08:54.433 --> 00:08:55.661
You know, Miss.

00:08:56.402 --> 00:08:58.962
Maybe you really should take a break.

00:08:59.205 --> 00:09:03.276
In all the time I've known you,
I've never seen you take time off.

00:09:03.276 --> 00:09:05.176
I'm a workaholic, okay?

00:09:05.378 --> 00:09:07.213
Nah, it's not about that...

00:09:07.213 --> 00:09:10.182
I know. You're worried for me, huh?

00:09:10.316 --> 00:09:11.484
Well, you know,

00:09:11.484 --> 00:09:14.420
you can tear up the tank all
you want and I can fix it for you,

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:18.720
but there's no replacing you or Bogie.

00:09:19.759 --> 00:09:20.953
I'll consider it.

00:09:21.027 --> 00:09:22.289
You do that.

00:09:25.665 --> 00:09:27.223
Thanks!

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.841
Honoka.

00:09:35.841 --> 00:09:37.410
You've got a message.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.711
From whom?

00:09:38.711 --> 00:09:39.700
From Paife.

00:09:40.513 --> 00:09:42.504
Sword Dancer, my ass!

00:09:42.982 --> 00:09:46.349
If you hadn't chickened out, by now, I could've...

00:09:46.619 --> 00:09:47.954
Look who's talking.

00:09:47.954 --> 00:09:50.218
You were plenty scared yourself!

00:09:50.556 --> 00:09:52.524
You don't know enough
about her in the first place!

00:09:53.159 --> 00:09:55.227
I can't say this too loud, but word is...

00:09:55.227 --> 00:09:57.496
...she took on the Inspection
Force's autonomous soldiers...

00:09:57.496 --> 00:09:59.532
...and came out without a scratch!

00:09:59.532 --> 00:10:01.432
Are you serious?

00:10:02.335 --> 00:10:04.428
You mentioned the Sword Dancer just now.

00:10:04.537 --> 00:10:06.198
Huh? Who the hell're you?

00:10:06.572 --> 00:10:09.268
Talk. Where do I go to find her?

00:10:09.909 --> 00:10:13.504
Is that any way to ask for information?!

00:10:13.579 --> 00:10:15.809
I'm in a bad mood right now!

00:10:20.386 --> 00:10:21.853
H-Hey!

00:10:23.122 --> 00:10:23.723
It hurts! It hurts!

00:10:23.723 --> 00:10:26.525
B-Bastard, what d'you do to him?!
It hurts! It hurts!

00:10:26.525 --> 00:10:26.592
It hurts! It hurts!

00:10:26.592 --> 00:10:27.393
Where do I go to find this Sword Dancer?
It hurts! It hurts!

00:10:27.393 --> 00:10:29.884
Where do I go to find this Sword Dancer?

00:10:45.344 --> 00:10:46.504
What's the matter?

00:10:46.846 --> 00:10:49.212
It's unusual for you to sigh like that.

00:10:53.152 --> 00:10:54.244
Iks...

00:11:03.129 --> 00:11:04.027
Coming!

00:11:05.197 --> 00:11:05.856
Oh...

00:11:06.966 --> 00:11:07.955
Hono?

00:11:08.167 --> 00:11:09.464
Long time no see.

00:11:10.202 --> 00:11:12.397
How've you been? Have you been good?

00:11:12.571 --> 00:11:14.040
When did you get back?

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.307
Just now.

00:11:15.307 --> 00:11:19.078
I thought I'd come by and see
how you're doing for a bit, but...

00:11:19.078 --> 00:11:20.946
Maybe I should've made it tomorrow instead?

00:11:20.946 --> 00:11:22.782
No way!

00:11:22.782 --> 00:11:23.771
Millie...

00:11:26.218 --> 00:11:28.721
Oh, wow!

00:11:28.721 --> 00:11:31.121
You look great in a skirt, Millie!

00:11:32.892 --> 00:11:34.792
Auntie bought it for me.

00:11:35.127 --> 00:11:38.264
I've never worn stuff like this,
but do you think it's weird?

00:11:38.264 --> 00:11:40.299
Not at all. It's really great!

00:11:40.299 --> 00:11:42.426
It's so girly and cute!

00:11:43.636 --> 00:11:46.935
Come to think of it, I've never worn a skirt.

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:48.868
Do you envy her?

00:11:49.175 --> 00:11:50.710
Oh, no, that's not it!

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:52.278
I wouldn't look good in one anyway!

00:11:52.278 --> 00:11:54.212
Do you like skirts, Iks?

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:55.142
What?

00:12:04.323 --> 00:12:05.449
Say, Millie...

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:12.263
You know, I'm thinking of taking
a break from work for a while.

00:12:12.732 --> 00:12:13.391
What?

00:12:13.866 --> 00:12:17.636
And I'm thinking of doing a little
cruising around out there.

00:12:17.636 --> 00:12:18.864
Out where?

00:12:19.004 --> 00:12:20.938
I haven't decided yet, but...

00:12:21.407 --> 00:12:24.865
Well, the kinds of places
I haven't been around to yet.

00:12:25.144 --> 00:12:27.780
Then, I won't be seeing you again for a while...

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:30.010
Oh, no, that's not it...

00:12:32.351 --> 00:12:33.943
Won't you come with us as well, Millie?

00:12:34.653 --> 00:12:35.449
What?

00:12:35.654 --> 00:12:37.723
This is a rare vacation, after all.

00:12:37.723 --> 00:12:39.391
I will also be going,

00:12:39.391 --> 00:12:41.951
but I think it would be even
more fun if you would join us.

00:12:42.928 --> 00:12:43.895
Really?!

00:12:45.231 --> 00:12:45.959
Yup.

00:12:48.768 --> 00:12:50.463
But, I can't.

00:12:51.203 --> 00:12:52.227
Why not?

00:12:52.805 --> 00:12:54.807
Because there's school...

00:12:54.807 --> 00:12:56.008
That's...

00:12:56.008 --> 00:12:58.377
You should go, Millie.

00:12:58.377 --> 00:12:59.469
What? Really?

00:13:00.412 --> 00:13:02.515
It's not often you get an opportunity like this...

00:13:02.515 --> 00:13:04.210
...and school isn't going anywhere.

00:13:04.717 --> 00:13:07.743
If it's something you can only do now,
you should do it now.

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:09.789
That's what I think.

00:13:09.789 --> 00:13:12.091
Really? It's really okay?

00:13:12.091 --> 00:13:12.825
Yes.

00:13:12.825 --> 00:13:13.692
Wanna come with?

00:13:13.692 --> 00:13:14.590
I'll come!

00:13:15.227 --> 00:13:16.262
Hey, Millie!

00:13:16.262 --> 00:13:16.728
I'll come!

00:13:25.604 --> 00:13:26.866
You did great in there.

00:13:27.606 --> 00:13:28.903
You were a big help.

00:13:28.974 --> 00:13:31.911
If it was just me, I don't know
how it would've turned out.

00:13:31.911 --> 00:13:32.969
Not at all...

00:13:33.412 --> 00:13:35.915
But the real problem is still ahead of us.

00:13:35.915 --> 00:13:36.882
Yeah...

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.919
I wonder if this was the
right sort of thing to do.

00:13:39.919 --> 00:13:40.248
What?

00:13:41.821 --> 00:13:45.552
I'm wondering if taking her on
a journey will resolve anything.

00:13:46.458 --> 00:13:50.588
I sort of feel like it might just
be postponing the issue.

00:13:51.363 --> 00:13:53.558
She apparently fell asleep in class.

00:13:54.667 --> 00:13:58.037
At first, it seemed like she'd just nodded off,

00:13:58.037 --> 00:14:00.597
but they eventually realized she
wasn't waking up no matter what.

00:14:01.207 --> 00:14:02.408
And then?

00:14:02.408 --> 00:14:03.742
There's nothing wrong with her.

00:14:03.742 --> 00:14:05.344
She slept until early evening...

00:14:05.344 --> 00:14:07.744
...and she seemed refreshed when she woke up.

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:09.648
So I sent her home.

00:14:09.648 --> 00:14:11.115
Lack of sleep?

00:14:12.184 --> 00:14:14.982
It doesn't look like the problem is that simple.

00:14:15.487 --> 00:14:17.990
It's probably an emotional issue.

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:19.457
Emotional?

00:14:22.161 --> 00:14:24.755
As you know, she's a very smart girl.

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:26.265
And kindhearted.

00:14:26.265 --> 00:14:30.133
Her character is pretty highly
developed for someone her age.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:33.598
But she's also exceptionally sensitive.

00:14:34.573 --> 00:14:38.134
PTSD... You've heard of it, haven't you?

00:14:38.510 --> 00:14:42.537
It's where some kind of traumatic
experience leaves a lasting effect.

00:14:43.082 --> 00:14:44.208
You mean...

00:14:55.694 --> 00:14:59.721
It was something that I should
have understood about her.

00:15:00.399 --> 00:15:03.836
I knew just how shocking it was for her,

00:15:03.836 --> 00:15:06.472
but I wasn't able to care for her.

00:15:06.472 --> 00:15:08.073
No matter who had been there,

00:15:08.073 --> 00:15:11.277
healing Millie's emotional trauma at that time...

00:15:11.277 --> 00:15:13.302
...would not have been an easy task.

00:15:14.613 --> 00:15:17.741
So blaming yourself is not...

00:15:21.887 --> 00:15:23.522
You know, the desert...

00:15:23.522 --> 00:15:26.892
...is a world filled with
wondrous things, cruel things,

00:15:26.892 --> 00:15:29.725
and tremendously beautiful things.

00:15:30.029 --> 00:15:33.766
I think that's why it also gives
rise to all sorts of legends.

00:15:33.766 --> 00:15:35.700
And you wish to show those things to Millie?

00:15:36.702 --> 00:15:39.571
She'd always traveled in a sort
of sheltered way, you know?

00:15:39.571 --> 00:15:41.835
What with the nature of the old man's business.

00:15:42.841 --> 00:15:46.679
I don't think she knows the
true joys of the desert.

00:15:46.679 --> 00:15:48.047
That's why...

00:15:48.047 --> 00:15:50.607
I'm sure she'll gain something out of it.

00:15:51.116 --> 00:15:52.549
I hope so.

00:15:53.852 --> 00:15:55.444
Hey, did you notice?

00:15:55.854 --> 00:15:56.786
Notice what?

00:15:56.889 --> 00:16:00.586
She's stopped referring to herself as "Millie".

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:02.049
What of it?

00:16:03.862 --> 00:16:06.422
It made me realize she's grown up.

00:16:06.865 --> 00:16:10.562
Maybe she doesn't need legends anymore...

00:16:13.439 --> 00:16:14.701
Pretty, isn't it?

00:16:15.808 --> 00:16:18.504
Yes. It is pretty, isn't it?

00:16:22.448 --> 00:16:27.010
Well, sure, it's done. But I mean,
you just said you were taking a break!

00:16:27.086 --> 00:16:29.021
And I am taking a break.

00:16:29.021 --> 00:16:31.023
I'm taking a little vacation trip.

00:16:31.023 --> 00:16:33.457
Sheesh! You sure are a restless one.

00:16:33.759 --> 00:16:36.193
That personality of yours is just...

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:39.192
What's wrong?

00:16:50.009 --> 00:16:54.279
For some reason, the area just
around the man seemed frigidly cold,

00:16:54.279 --> 00:16:55.906
or so it felt to Honoka.

00:16:59.585 --> 00:17:00.719
An acquaintance of yours, Miss?

00:17:00.719 --> 00:17:01.447
No.

00:17:02.221 --> 00:17:04.590
So, you're... her, I guess.

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:06.925
The Sword Dancer. Am I wrong?

00:17:06.925 --> 00:17:08.227
Who the hell are you?!

00:17:08.227 --> 00:17:12.664
Some people call me that. My real
name is Honoka. Remember that.

00:17:13.098 --> 00:17:14.895
Honoka, huh?

00:17:15.734 --> 00:17:17.395
Leon. I'm a hunter.

00:17:17.903 --> 00:17:20.565
Hmm, so what's this?

00:17:20.773 --> 00:17:23.674
It's apparently thanks for telling her about Millie.

00:17:24.109 --> 00:17:25.411
She's getting ready to leave, so...

00:17:25.411 --> 00:17:26.878
...she didn't think she'd make it here by today.

00:17:27.312 --> 00:17:28.904
She didn't have to do that.

00:17:29.581 --> 00:17:33.847
But well, I like this coffee,
so I'll accept it with gratitude.

00:17:33.986 --> 00:17:36.321
So, are you planning on going with them?

00:17:36.321 --> 00:17:37.589
On the trip, you mean?

00:17:37.589 --> 00:17:38.351
Yeah.

00:17:38.657 --> 00:17:39.851
Would that be wrong?

00:17:40.025 --> 00:17:41.754
Why are you asking me?

00:17:42.227 --> 00:17:43.660
Hono said you could go, right?

00:17:44.363 --> 00:17:47.161
Then, why don't you join us as well, Teacher?

00:17:47.633 --> 00:17:50.966
You've got no reason to call me "Teacher".

00:17:51.303 --> 00:17:55.205
Unlike you two, I'm not so
happy-go-lucky, I'm afraid.

00:17:55.607 --> 00:17:57.507
I am sorry to hear that.

00:17:58.444 --> 00:18:00.935
Like water off a duck's back, huh? Honestly...

00:18:01.447 --> 00:18:02.181
So?

00:18:02.181 --> 00:18:02.943
What?

00:18:03.649 --> 00:18:04.911
How's Hono?

00:18:05.551 --> 00:18:06.381
Oh...

00:18:07.086 --> 00:18:11.090
The same as always... would be nice,
but not this time.

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:14.423
I've never seen Miss Honoka sigh so much.

00:18:23.368 --> 00:18:26.633
There's something I'd like for
you to pass on to Hono for me.

00:18:27.139 --> 00:18:28.231
What is it?

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:31.805
Millie used to come by this room often.

00:18:32.444 --> 00:18:34.412
She'd come to talk to me.

00:18:35.247 --> 00:18:36.646
What do you suppose she'd talk about?

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:40.177
About Miss Honoka, correct?

00:18:40.786 --> 00:18:41.616
Yeah.

00:18:42.221 --> 00:18:44.690
Because I'm an acquaintance of Hono's,

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:47.682
she'd talk about all sorts of
things and leave with a smile.

00:18:47.993 --> 00:18:49.756
With true and sincere joy.

00:18:50.562 --> 00:18:54.191
She loves Hono, you know. Really loves her.

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:56.162
To the point that it makes me jealous.

00:18:57.603 --> 00:18:59.195
I will be sure to let her know.

00:18:59.605 --> 00:19:02.199
Fairy? The Desert Fairy?

00:19:02.774 --> 00:19:04.409
You seem to know about it.

00:19:04.409 --> 00:19:07.435
Know about it maybe,
but it's just a legend, isn't it?

00:19:07.813 --> 00:19:10.441
That's the target of my hunting endeavors.

00:19:11.116 --> 00:19:12.242
You're joking.

00:19:12.484 --> 00:19:15.454
I'm not familiar with the local geography.

00:19:15.454 --> 00:19:18.685
I'd appreciate it if you'd
come with me as my guide.

00:19:20.192 --> 00:19:22.183
You seem serious about this.

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:26.231
I'm sorry,

00:19:26.231 --> 00:19:29.334
but something's come up and I'm
taking some time off from work.

00:19:29.334 --> 00:19:32.037
Want me to introduce you to someone else?

00:19:32.037 --> 00:19:35.974
No. I've heard that the Sword Dancer
is the best there is in these parts.

00:19:35.974 --> 00:19:38.844
No need to go to the trouble
of asking anyone else.

00:19:38.844 --> 00:19:40.368
I appreciate you saying that.

00:19:40.612 --> 00:19:41.909
Sorry. Bye.

00:19:42.314 --> 00:19:43.645
You've got a good eye.

00:19:44.349 --> 00:19:47.147
Huh? Really? My instinct's nothing special.

00:19:47.352 --> 00:19:48.546
That's not what I mean.

00:19:49.054 --> 00:19:51.750
I mean your other... eye.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:03.928
I have a feeling we'll meet again.

00:20:12.511 --> 00:20:15.537
Hey there, Auntie!

00:20:15.714 --> 00:20:17.511
Be careful now!

00:20:17.749 --> 00:20:18.909
I will!

00:20:20.285 --> 00:20:21.616
I'm sorry, Hono.

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.251
Please take care of Millie.

00:20:23.488 --> 00:20:25.891
I feel bad, but please let me
depend on you for now.

00:20:25.891 --> 00:20:29.156
Oh, no... I'm happy that you would trust me.

00:20:30.862 --> 00:20:32.989
See you later!

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:46.040
Get out.

00:20:46.211 --> 00:20:47.610
What are you doing here?

00:20:51.283 --> 00:20:54.081
As you can see, I'm looking for prey.

00:20:54.386 --> 00:20:55.284
A hunter?

00:20:55.654 --> 00:20:56.916
Is there a problem?

00:20:57.222 --> 00:20:58.883
You will allow us to do a check.

00:21:00.726 --> 00:21:03.286
This area is quite a distance from any towns.

00:21:03.595 --> 00:21:06.029
Where do you plan to go
with such light equipment?

00:21:06.198 --> 00:21:07.165
Nowhere.

00:21:07.165 --> 00:21:07.833
What?

00:21:07.833 --> 00:21:10.202
This is the world that suits me.

00:21:10.202 --> 00:21:12.295
I don't plan on going anywhere else now.

00:21:28.387 --> 00:21:31.914
Desert... ghost...

00:21:36.228 --> 00:21:39.823
Looks like I've still got it.

00:21:41.533 --> 00:21:44.969
In the desert, there are legends.

00:21:52.978 --> 00:21:56.381
An intersection waiting for morning...
Asa o matteiru kousaten ga

00:21:56.381 --> 00:22:00.419
...cradling an abandoned cat that wandered in.
Mayoikonda sute-neko o daiteiru

00:22:00.419 --> 00:22:03.021
Red and green and yellow.
Aka to ao to kiiro

00:22:03.021 --> 00:22:06.115
It is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:06.692 --> 00:22:10.195
Stopping just after dawn,
Akegata-sugi ni furiyanda

00:22:10.195 --> 00:22:14.132
a misty rain made a screen of water.
Kosame ga tsukutta mizu no sukuriin ga

00:22:14.132 --> 00:22:16.735
Until that time when it dries,
Kawaku sono toki made

00:22:16.735 --> 00:22:19.829
it is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:20.005 --> 00:22:23.408
More than small coincidences like that,
Sonna chiisana guuzen yori mo

00:22:23.408 --> 00:22:26.878
the fact that you are there...
Kimi ga soko ni iru koto ga

00:22:26.878 --> 00:22:30.115
...cannot be a small thing, I think.
Chiisai hazu ga nai to omounda

00:22:30.115 --> 00:22:33.949
Even though it's obvious.
Atarimae nandakedo

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:42.461
It must be sad not to have anyone.
Daremo inai to kanashii koto deshou

00:22:42.461 --> 00:22:49.162
Now, come on out to where the sun is shining.
Saa hi no ataru basho e dete-oide

00:22:49.234 --> 00:22:56.041
Even the several incidents that trouble you...
Kimi o komaraseru ikutsuka no dekigoto mo

00:22:56.041 --> 00:23:01.240
...are coincidences of yesterdays past.
Kinou izen no guuzen nanda yo

00:23:03.014 --> 00:23:08.884
Though, I'm sure you actually know that already.
Hontou wa wakatteru to omou kedo

00:23:15.193 --> 00:23:16.888
Preview

00:23:17.129 --> 00:23:18.830
A journey with Millie in tow.

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:22.391
We enjoyed the desert as it
showed us its many faces.

00:23:22.768 --> 00:23:26.238
But not understanding Millie's feelings,

00:23:26.238 --> 00:23:28.172
I end up making her cry again.

00:23:28.373 --> 00:23:30.967
And a desert monster suddenly
appeared before her...

00:23:31.042 --> 00:23:33.169
...as she ran away from me.

00:23:33.478 --> 00:23:37.616
I tried to save her, but just when
my reach wasn't long enough...

00:23:37.616 --> 00:23:40.886
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:40.886 --> 00:23:42.053
episode 14, "Fairy Visions".

00:23:42.053 --> 00:23:43.388
Fairy Visions
episode 14, "Fairy Visions".

00:23:43.388 --> 00:23:44.912
Fairy Visions
